   "description": "Persona 'user_b' retrieved persona 'user_a''s object through a real browser session by changing only the object id in a request the application itself makes at runtime. the attacker persona's browser received the owner's object verbatim (200, 154 bytes) while anonymous=401 and implausible-id=200 did not",
